<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia July trade surplus $508.5 mln-sources.</title>
<headline>Indonesia July trade surplus $508.5 mln-sources.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's trade surplus in July was $508.5 million against $193.4 million in June, government sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>They said exports in July totalled $4.066 billion and imports were $3.558 billion. Oil and gas exports comprised $909.7 million, they said.</p>
<p>Full details would be given after the monthly meeting of the cabinet later on Wednesday, they said.</p>
</text>
